    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present Manresa, Old Naas Road, Bluebell, Dublin 12, a unique opportunity to acquire a substantial detached residence on an exceptional in a highly accessible and well-established location.\n\nExtending to approximately 195 sq.m / 2,099 sq.ft, Manresa offers spacious accommodation throughout and will appeal to those seeking a family home with excellent potential. However, the property's most striking feature is undoubtedly its site. Occupying more than half an acre and benefiting from direct road access, the grounds represent a rare opportunity in an increasingly sought-after area of Dublin.\n\nProperties of this scale seldom come to the market, offering purchasers the flexibility to modernise and extend the existing home or explore future development opportunities, subject to the necessary planning permissions. The generous site size, combined with its prominent position and excellent accessibility, makes this an attractive proposition for owner-occupiers, investors and developers alike.\n\nThe location is superb, with the LUAS Red Line, M50, N7 and Dublin City Centre all within easy reach. A wide range of local amenities, schools, shops and sporting facilities are nearby, while the surrounding area continues to benefit from ongoing regeneration and investment.\n\nManresa is a property of genuine rarity, combining a substantial detached home with a large site in a prime Dublin location, offering outstanding potential for the future."
      },
